{"version":1,"content":"<p>正就民主派「35+」案服刑的前香港眾志秘書長黃之鋒，被指與前香港眾志創黨主席羅冠聰串謀請求外國制裁中國及香港，早前承認一項「串謀勾結外國或者境外勢力危害國家安全」罪。</p><p>司法機構網頁顯示，案件將本周四（5日）早上9時半由法官譚耀豪判刑，料需約半小時。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:37.118679+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:47:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T18:18:16.943419+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:41.037901+00:00","content_hash":"da4a9f0ad36eefcca4c66412e29ffc324fe94d73a2fdc1fc5ba3059fcef9916a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}